{"headword":"מַחְשָׁךְ","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>n.m. dark place</strong> (poet.)—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 29:15\" href=\"/Isaiah.29.15\">Is 29:15</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 42:16\" href=\"/Isaiah.42.16\">42:16</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מַחְשָׁ֑ךְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 88:19\" href=\"/Psalms.88.19\">ψ 88:19</a>; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַחֲשַׁכִּים</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 88:7\" href=\"/Psalms.88.7\">88:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 143:3\" href=\"/Psalms.143.3\">143:3</a> = <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 3:6\" href=\"/Lamentations.3.6\">La 3:6</a>; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַחֲשַׁכֵּי</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 74:20\" href=\"/Psalms.74.20\">ψ 74:20</a>;—<em>dark place:</em>"},{"senses":[{"definition":"= <em>hiding-place</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">מח׳־ארץ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 74:20\" href=\"/Psalms.74.20\">74:20</a>."}],"num":"a."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>dark region</em>, in which men may lose their way <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 42:16\" href=\"/Isaiah.42.16\">Is 42:16</a>."}],"num":"b."},{"senses":[{"definition":"= <em>grave</em>, or <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁאול</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 88:19\" href=\"/Psalms.88.19\">ψ 88:19</a> (v. Che); of dark place of God’s wrath (like Sheʾôl) <a data-ref=\"Psalms 88:7\" href=\"/Psalms.88.7\">88:7</a>; cf. <a data-ref=\"Psalms 143:3\" href=\"/Psalms.143.3\">143:3</a> = <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 3:6\" href=\"/Lamentations.3.6\">La 3:6</a>."}],"num":"c."},{"senses":[{"definition":"= <em>secret place, secrecy</em> (of plots) <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 29:15\" href=\"/Isaiah.29.15\">Is 29:15</a>."}],"num":"d."}]},"rid":"BDB03571","strong_numbers":["4285"],"next_hw":"חָשַׁל","prev_hw":"חֲשֵׁכָה","all_cited":true,"quotes":[],"GK":["4743"],"TWOT":["769d"],"parent_lexicon_details":{"name":"BDB Dictionary","language":"heb.biblical","to_language":"eng","text_categories":[],"source":"BDB Dictionary","attribution":"F. Brown, S. Driver & C. Briggs","index_title":"